('<div class="kicker">常见问题</div><h2>你可能想问</h2>','<div class="kicker">FAQ</div><h2>Questions you might have</h2>'),
('<summary>跟 Wealthsimple 有什么不一样？</summary><p>Wealthsimple 只看得到它自己的账户，自动税损收割也只面向它的部分客户。LoonTax 把你在 Questrade、IBKR 等不同券商、不同账户（包括 TFSA、RRSP）的交易放在一起算，所以能发现“在另一个账户买回”导致的 superficial loss。</p>','<summary>How is this different from Wealthsimple?</summary><p>Wealthsimple sees only its own accounts, and its automatic tax-loss harvesting is for some of its clients only. LoonTax puts trades from Questrade, IBKR and your other accounts — TFSA and RRSP included — in one ledger, so it catches superficial losses from a rebuy in another account.</p>'),
('<summary>我的数据安全吗？</summary><p>计算全部在你的浏览器里完成，交易文件不会上传到我们的服务器。我们不需要、也不会要你的券商密码。</p>','<summary>Is my data safe?</summary><p>All calculation happens in your browser. Your trade files are never uploaded to our servers, and we never ask for broker passwords.</p>'),
('<summary>TFSA / RRSP 里的交易要算吗？</summary><p>注册账户里的买卖本身不报资本利得，但会影响 superficial loss 判断。LoonTax 会把它们纳入识别，不计入应税收益。</p>','<summary>What about TFSA / RRSP trades?</summary><p>They aren’t reported as capital gains, but they can trigger a superficial loss. LoonTax checks them for that and leaves them out of taxable gains.</p>'),
('<summary>年底体检会告诉我该卖什么吗？</summary><p>不会。它只算“如果今天卖出，税会怎样”，不建议你买卖哪一只。投资决定请自己判断，或咨询持牌顾问。</p>','<summary>Will the year-end check tell me what to sell?</summary><p>No. It shows what selling today would mean for your taxes, not what to buy or sell. That decision is yours, or a licensed advisor’s.</p>'),
('<summary>能代替会计吗？</summary><p>不能，也不打算。它把最费时的计算做完、留下可追溯的明细。复杂情况（公司账户、期权、跨境税务居民身份）请咨询专业人士。</p>','<summary>Does it replace an accountant?</summary><p>No. It does the time-consuming math and leaves a traceable trail. For corporate accounts, options or cross-border residency, talk to a professional.</p>'),
('<summary>为什么报税报告要等到 2027 年 2 月？</summary><p>券商通常在 2 月底前发出税表，ETF 的分配构成（含资本返还）也在年初陆续公布。数据齐全了，结果才准确。</p>','<summary>Why does the tax report wait until February 2027?</summary><p>Brokers send slips by the end of February, and ETF distribution breakdowns (return of capital included) come out early in the year. Accurate results need that data.</p>'),
('<summary>不满意可以退款吗？</summary><p>可以。购买后 30 天内，如果报告对你没用，联系我们即全额退款。</p>','<summary>Can I get a refund?</summary><p>Yes. If the report isn’t useful, contact us within 30 days of purchase for a full refund.</p>'),
