('LoonTax 是计算辅助工具，不构成税务、法律或投资建议。报告结果请自行核对，或与持牌专业人士确认。LoonTax 与 CRA、加拿大央行及文中提到的任何券商均无关联。','LoonTax is a calculation aid, not tax, legal or investment advice. Check your results, or confirm them with a licensed professional. LoonTax is not affiliated with the CRA, the Bank of Canada or any broker named on this page.'),
